			"styles": "\n\tdiv {\n\t\t/* a comment trailing a value stays inside the declaration it was written in —\n\t\tthe semicolon beside it is the one tsv emits, not one the author wrote */\n\t\tcolor: red;\n\t\ttop: 0 /* comment */;\n\t}\n\tspan {\n\t\ttop: 0 /* comment1 */ /* comment2 */;\n\t}\n\tp {\n\t\ttop: 0 /* comment */;\n\t}\n",
